  "stories": [
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Profile",
        "zh": "客观履历",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Initially a patient at Rhodes Island, Popukar requested and passed the trial to become an Operator for Rhodes Island. She was assigned to Reserve Op Team A6.\nShe possesses tremendous destructive power, becoming the team's heavy.",
        "zh": "作为患者被罗德岛接收，因能力出众，在征求本人意见后，接受并通过测试，成为罗德岛的一员，被分配到预备行动组A6。\n拥有出色的破坏力，是小队的攻坚手。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "DIRECT"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Clinical Analysis",
        "zh": "临床诊断分析",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Imaging test for this Operator showed blurry outline of internal organs with visible unusual dark spots. Unusually high concentration of Originium particles were present in her circulation, indicating signs of infection and confirming her as infected at this stage. \n\n[Cell-Originium Assimilation] 3% \nCrystallization visible on surface of body, with many symptoms of Oripathy. \n\n[Blood Originium-Crystal Density] 0.2u/L \nSubject is currently stabilized, but regular observation and treatment are required.",
        "zh": "造影检测结果显示，该干员体内脏器轮廓模糊，可见异常阴影，循环系统内源石颗粒检测异常，有矿石病感染迹象，现阶段可确认为矿石病感染者。\n\n【体细胞与源石融合率】3%\n包括体表的源石结晶在内，干员泡普卡拥有明显的感染者症状。\n\n【血液源石结晶密度】0.2u/L\n患者目前病程控制稳定。需要保持定期观察与控制。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "25"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 1",
        "zh": "档案资料一",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "A member of Reserve Op Team A6. Although not capable of complex reasoning, her infection bestowed on her an ability that made her a suitable Operator. \nThe source of a lot of problems for Team A6, most of these are unintentional. Because of her sincerity, she is also the easiest to forgive.",
        "zh": "预备行动组A6的一员。虽然心智水平不足以承担复杂工作，但通过矿石病感染获得的怪力使得她破格成为了干员。\n是A6的麻烦制造者，经常无意之间闯祸。但因为态度诚恳，也是最容易被原谅的一个。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "50"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 2",
        "zh": "档案资料二",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Unlike most other members, Popukar was taken in by Dr. Kal'tsit personally.\n Dr. Kal'tsit did not explain why she made this choice, only saying Popukar would stay on as a full-time member of Rhodes Island. \nHowever, Dr. Ansel said that was the first time she had ever seen Dr. Kal'tsit visibly upset.",
        "zh": "和大部分干员有所不同，泡普卡是被凯尔希医生捡回来的。\n凯尔希医生对于为何将她带回来一事并没有作过多说明，只是表示从今往后她将作为罗德岛的一员生活。\n不过，据当时同行的安赛尔医生表示，那是他第一次看到凯尔希医生生气的样子。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "100"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 3",
        "zh": "档案资料三",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Although Popukar failed her Operator exam, she was allowed to work in logistics, rather than being cast out. \nAnd as it is so rare for an infection to make a patient stronger, even rarer to the extent of Popukar's infection, she is a very valuable case study.",
        "zh": "当然，即使泡普卡没有通过干员测试，无家可归的她也能够获得后勤的工作。\n另外，感染矿石病后在力量方面得到强化的病例本身就不多，像泡普卡这样得到极大强化的更是少见，从这个意义上，她的存在也很有价值。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "150"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 4",
        "zh": "档案资料四",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Popukar has gradually become one of the mascots of Rhodes Island. After all, no one could hate such an energetic little cutie -- even if she occasionally engages in 'minor' vandalism. \nMoreover, since joining A6, she has a much bigger family. Their shenanigans are just part of the Rhodes Island color nowadays.",
        "zh": "泡普卡逐渐成为了罗德岛的吉祥物之一。毕竟，没有人会讨厌这样一个朝气蓬勃的小可爱——虽然这个小可爱偶尔还是会不小心搞点“小”破坏出来。\n而且，在被编入A6后，她还多了许多家人，这一家子的鸡飞狗跳，如今也是罗德岛基地的风景之一。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "200"
    }
  ]
}
